	"Description": "Modular cosmetic themes (skin-cosmetici-modulari.md): a theme is sold once and decorates any conforming item. Items declare where they can be decorated (slots with envelopes, decorative splines), themes declare how (pieces per slot class, spline modules, a layered material and style channels). Phase 1: data, the deterministic placement plan, validation and the cache key. Presentation only: nothing in the simulation reads it, pieces never collide.",
